0x4C37F98E  cre_flg_Impl            ; cre_flg's body, behind the wrapper cre_flg; program 942's exported cre_flg_X calls the wrapper, carried here by an identical body
0x4C37FC2C  prcv_msg                ; uITRON prcv_msg: the service-call wrapper (context save, kernel stack, call prcv_msg_Impl); KernelErrorHook d0 = -61 (H'ffc3, rcv_msg's code: the polling variant), d1 = the poll's result (uITRON 3.0 sect. 6.3; ../kn7000/notes/uitron3-function-codes)
0x4C37FCB8  prcv_msg_Impl           ; prcv_msg's body, behind the wrapper prcv_msg; KernelErrorHook d0 = -61 (H'ffc3, rcv_msg's code: the polling variant), d1 = the poll's result (uITRON 3.0 sect. 6.3; ../kn7000/notes/uitron3-function-codes)
0x4C37FD23  cre_mpl                 ; uITRON cre_mpl: the service-call wrapper (context save, kernel stack, call cre_mpl_Impl); KernelErrorHook d0 = -137 (H'ff77, cre_mpl), d1 = E_NOMEM (uITRON 3.0 sect. 6.3; ../kn7000/notes/uitron3-function-codes)
0x4C37FDAF  cre_mpl_Impl            ; cre_mpl's body, behind the wrapper cre_mpl; KernelErrorHook d0 = -137 (H'ff77, cre_mpl), d1 = E_NOMEM (uITRON 3.0 sect. 6.3; ../kn7000/notes/uitron3-function-codes)
